"Pay for Payment: ad alcuni ordini potrebbero mancare le tariffe di pagamento."

#. translators: %s: sampled period ("the last 7 days").
#: src/Pro/FeeWatchdog.php:378
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Orders placed over %s were paid with the methods below but carry no payment "
